            "review_title": "Review at Anh Restaurant",
            "review_text": "DaveMcCabe45\nDarlington, United Kingdom41 contributions\n1\nLovely Vietnamese food\nMar 2018 • Friends\nI was taken into the restaurant by the owner who looked after my order. Food was spot on and not expensive. I sampled several Vietnamese dishes all were nice. Only thing I’ve found, this is almost everywhere in Vietnam, the waiters or waitresses are asking what you want as soon as you get the menu. It comes across a little rude and impatient. Give people chance to look at the menu then take the order. I think they are probably trying to help but everything seems to be a rush. But food was fine.\nRead more\nWritten April 2, 2018",
